direct effects. But perhaps there are also ways to take advantage of this imbalance...<br>The threatened world that Ryu travels through is full of secrets and dangers. The environment changes every time the player begins his journey. Each journey also means new challenges that he must face. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364230/extras/cc477f837637721cb590727ba5756b23.webp?t=1729061627\" /></span><br><br><strong>Join the discord!</strong><br><br>",
